":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-29T18:43:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T06:19:34Z","closed_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122981","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122981.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122981.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:07Z"},"body":"Adds a new signal to `ScenePaint2DEditor` that is emitted when drawing, as discussed with KoBeWi [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15439#issuecomment-5462806287).\r\n\r\nThis allows you to conveniently control how nodes are created, such as random rotation, scale, color, and so on.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nvar _paint_editor\r\n\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\t_paint_editor = EditorInterface.get_scene_paint_2d()\r\n\t_paint_editor.connect(\"scene_painted\", _on_scene_painted)\r\n\r\nfunc _on_scene_painted(node: Node2D) -> void:\r\n\tprint(node.name)\r\n\tnode.rotation = randf_range(0,360)\r\n\tvar sc_rnd = randf_range(0.5,1.5)\r\n\tnode.scale =  Vector2(sc_rnd,sc_rnd)\r\n\tnode.modulate = Color(randf_range(0,1),randf_range(0,1),randf_range(0,1))\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes [Add the ability to randomize rotation and scale in 2D node drawing mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15439)\r\n\r\nFor level designers and artists, there's also an additional PR (#122859 )  that removes the need for programming.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122981/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122981/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}